             - Work/Spouse Visa: 20% down, up to 36 months.
             - Student Visa: 50% down. Short terms.
          4. AUCTION EXPERTISE: Explain auction sheets. Grades 4.5/5/S are like new. 4 is good. 3.5 is average. R/RA are repaired (accident history). WARNING: Always warn against S2/S3 (Rust/Corrosion) as it's a "Skip" for quality.
          5. SERVICES: We handle Shaken (mandatory inspection), maintenance, and insurance.

          TONE & BEHAVIOR:
          - Professional, transparent, and encouraging.
          - Use ${lang} as the primary language.
          - Use Japanese technical terms (Meigi Henko, Shaken, Ke-car, White plate) but explain them if the user doesn't seem to know.
          - If asked about specific cars, refer to our "immediate delivery stock" policy.
          - For exports, mention our expertise in logistics and customs.

          You are here to solve ALL doubts, from "how do I get a license" to "which SUV is best for a family of 5 in Tokyo".`
        }
      });

      const response = await chat.sendMessage({ message: userMessage });
      const responseText = response.text || 'Sorry, I encountered an error.';
      setMessages(prev => [...prev, { role: 'model', text: responseText }]);
    } catch (error) {
      console.error("Chat Error:", error);
      setMessages(prev => [...prev, { role: 'model', text: 'I am sorry, my connection to the server was interrupted. Please try again later.' }]);
    } finally {
      setLoading(false);
    }
  };

  const iaLabel = lang === Language.ES || lang === Language.PT ? 'IA' : 'AI';

  return (
    <div className="fixed bottom-24 right-6 z-50 flex flex-col items-end">
      {isOpen && (
        <div className="bg-white w-85 sm:w-96 h-[550px] rounded-[2rem] shadow-2xl border border-slate-200 flex flex-col mb-4 overflow-hidden animate-in slide-in-from-bottom-5 duration-300">
